        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBR6050, Solid Brass Wire Soap Basket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis wall mounted wire basket is perfect for holding shampoo bottles in the bathroom. The sleek design means that it is easy to clean. Measuring 6\" long and 4-7/8\" wide, it is large enough to hold all your shower supplies without being too bulky. It is made out of solid brass and is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and pvd polished brass finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR6050-specifications.gif?v=1704354741\" width=\"524\" height=\"370\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBR6050 6\" Rectangular Wire Soap Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBR6050 Solid Brass Shower Supplies Basket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR6050.pdf?v=1704262291\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBR6050 6\" Rectangular Wire Soap Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
